<a href="#all-3" class="single-testimonial type-article" data-cat="article">
	<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://yellow.ai/wp-content/themes/yellow.ai/img/v2/quotes-yellow.svg" alt="Quotes" class="quotes">
			<div class="content">
			<div class="content-wrap p1">
				<p>“We’re a private dermatology practice with 5 locations, and keeping up with incoming call volume was a challenge. Since going live with Yellow.ai, we’ve already seen a good decrease in calls being transferred to our agents. What’s been most valuable is the consistent, open dialogue with the Yellow.ai team; patients are unpredictable,<strong> so having a partner that helps us tweak and add use cases as we learn has been key</strong>.”</p>
			</div>
