<a href="#article-8" class="single-testimonial type-article" data-cat="article">
	<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://yellow.ai/wp-content/themes/yellow.ai/img/v2/quotes-yellow.svg" alt="Quotes" class="quotes">
			<div class="content">
			<div class="content-wrap p1">
				<p>“With our constantly expanding customer base and vast network of dealers, Sony India recognizes the need to provide 24&#215;7 assistance with a dedicated helpline for quick sales and service support. With deep back-end integration with the Sony CRM, the voice AI agent collects, records and analyzes user information to deliver personalized experiences. We are pleased to join hands with Yellow.ai for their support in taking Sony’s exceptional customer service support a notch higher. Within two months of going live, ‘Isha’ has successfully handled over 21,000 customer and dealer calls with seamless integration. As always, we value our customers who are an integral part of our growth and we endeavour to deliver the best-in-class customer experience&#8221;.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
