			<div class="content">
			<div class="content-wrap p1">
				<p>“With the pace at which the digital wave is changing India, every sector is looking for opportunities to leverage technology in the best way, and the government sector is no different. Bengaluru Namma Metro’s recently launched WhatsApp-based QR ticketing service is a huge step towards providing commuters with a hassle-free experience. The multilingual chatbot enabled by Yellow.ai is helping over 100,000 commuters with various essential services such as recharging metro smart cards, journey planning, locating the nearest metro stations, and getting fare information, ensuring a seamless customer experience.”</p>
